---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { base } from 'astro:config/client';
---

	<Layout title="About VO2 Bikes | Verified Pre-owned Bikes" description="Learn how VO2 Bikes selects and verifies pre-owned cycling bikes.">
		<section class="about-hero">
			<div class="about-inner">
				<p class="eyebrow">Better bikes. Better backed.</p>
				<h1 class="display-heading">Ride with<br />more <span>certainty.</span></h1>
			</div>
		</section>
		<section class="about-content">
			<div class="about-inner">
				<p class="eyebrow">Built by Riders. Driven by Trust.</p>
				<div class="about-copy">
					<p>At VO<sub>2</sub> Bikes, cycling is more than a hobby. It's a pursuit of progress, performance and new possibilities.</p>
					<p>As cyclists and aspiring triathletes ourselves, we understand the journey — from the first ride to the training sessions, challenging climbs and finish lines that make every effort worthwhile. We also know that finding the right bike matters. But when buying pre-owned, knowing exactly what you're getting can be just as important as finding the right price.</p>
					<p>That's why we started VO<sub>2</sub> Bikes.</p>
					<p>Our mission is to make buying and selling pre-owned bicycles a more transparent, dependable and rider-focused experience. We carefully select quality bikes and evaluate each one against the same detailed inspection standard. Every listing includes an inspection score, category-wise results and bike-specific notes, giving you a clearer picture of the bike's condition and helping you compare options with confidence.</p>
					<p>We believe trust comes from transparency. By communicating known issues honestly and documenting each bike's condition, we aim to help riders make informed decisions and find a bike that delivers the right balance of quality, performance and value.</p>
					<p>
						Here's what we're building differently:
						<ul>
							<li>
								🔍Inspection before listing — We follow a structured process to assess the frame, fork, wheels, brakes, drivetrain and key components.
							</li>
							<li>
								📋Transparency that matters — We document known defects, condition and work carried out, rather than leaving you to discover surprises later.
							</li>
							<li>
								⚙️Value, not just a low price — We help you explore bikes with the specifications and performance you want, at a price that makes sense for you.
							</li>
							<li>
								🤝Cyclist-first thinking — We're building this brand around the things riders care about: the bike, the details and the ride ahead.
							</li>
						</ul>
					</p>
					<p>Whether you're buying your first road bike, looking for your next upgrade, or preparing for your next big challenge, we're here to help you choose a ride that fits your ambitions.</p>
					<p>We're riders building something for riders — with trust at the heart of every ride.</p>
					<a class="button-primary" href={`${base}/inspection/`}>Our inspection standard <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>
		<section class="shop-facts" aria-label="vo2bikes standards">
			<div><span>01 / EVERY LISTING</span><strong>Pre-owned only</strong></div>
			<div><span>02 / SAME STANDARD</span><strong>100-point inspection</strong></div>
			<div><span>03 / NO GUESSWORK</span><strong>Score shown upfront</strong></div>
		</section>
	</Layout>

<style>
	.about-hero { padding: 5rem 0 3.5rem; }
	.about-inner { max-width: 100vw; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 clamp(1.25rem, 10vw, 10rem); }
	.about-content { padding: 3.5rem 0 4.5rem; background: #080c0f; }
	.about-hero .display-heading { font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 6.4vw, 5.16rem); }
	.about-hero .display-heading span { color: var(--signal); }
	.about-copy p, ul { color: #cfdddf; font-size: 0.83rem; line-height: 1.85; }
	.about-copy p.about-signoff { margin: 1.6rem 0 0; color: var(--paper); font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif; font-size: 1.3rem; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.15; letter-spacing: 0.02em; text-transform: uppercase; }
	.about-copy .about-signoff span { color: var(--signal); }
	.about-copy .button-primary { margin-top: 1rem; }
	.shop-facts { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 1rem; padding: 2.25rem clamp(1.25rem, 10vw, 10rem); border-top: 1px solid var(--line); background: rgba(8, 12, 15, 0.94); }
	.shop-facts div { display: grid; gap: 0.5rem; }
	.shop-facts span { color: var(--signal); font-size: 0.6rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.12em; }
	.shop-facts strong { font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif; font-size: 1.3rem; font-weight: 600; text-transform: uppercase; }
	@media (max-width: 760px) { .about-hero { padding-top: 3.5rem; padding-bottom: 2.5rem; } .about-content { padding-top: 3rem; padding-bottom: 3.5rem; } .shop-facts { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 1.3rem; } }
</style>
